1
00:06:25,714 --> 00:06:31,714
Has there  ever been a story  in which nature,  God, man, and animals were
so united  in sorrow, fighting, and rejoicing together?

2
00:12:51,428 --> 00:12:57,428
Ramayana: The Legend of Prince Rama is a animation,
action, adventure film directed by Ram Mohan.

3
00:19:17,142 --> 00:19:23,142
In Ayodhya, the royal palace of Kosala Kingdom in Ancient India, four princes
were born to three queens, each of whom grew to great stature.

4
00:25:42,857 --> 00:25:48,857
Banished for 14 years due to court intrigue, Prince Rama
retreated to the forest with his beautiful wife Sita.

5
00:32:08,571 --> 00:32:14,571
When Rama vanquishes the demons of the forest, he invites the
wrath of the demon king Ravana, who kidnaps Sita.

6
00:38:34,285 --> 00:38:40,285
Based on the Indian epic the Ramayana.

7
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Rama (Voice), played by Nikhil Kapoor.

8
00:51:25,714 --> 00:51:31,714
Sita (Voice), played by Raell Padamsee.

9
00:57:51,428 --> 00:57:57,428
Raavana (voice), played by Uday Mathan.

10
01:04:17,142 --> 01:04:23,142
Lakshman (voice) (English), played by Mishal Verma.

11
01:10:42,857 --> 01:10:48,857
Hanuman (Voice) (English), played by Noel Godin.

12
01:17:08,571 --> 01:17:14,571
Sugreeva (voice) (English), played by Denzil Smith.

13
01:23:34,285 --> 01:23:40,285
Ramayana: The Legend of Prince Rama is a 1993 anime film co-produced by
Japan and India; produced and directed by Yugo Sako.

14
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
It is based on the Indian epic Ramayana.

15
01:36:25,714 --> 01:36:31,714
The film was directed by Koichi Sasaki, Ram Mohan, and Yugo
Sako with music composed by Vanraj Bhatia.

16
01:42:51,428 --> 01:42:57,428
The film was first released in India at the 24th
International Film Festival of India.

17
01:49:17,142 --> 01:49:23,142
It was also screened at the 1993 Vancouver International Film Festival.

18
01:55:42,857 --> 01:55:48,857
Subsequently, a Hindi dubbed version was released in the late 1990s.

19
02:02:08,571 --> 02:02:14,571
On Jan 24, 2025, it was re-released in theatres in 4K with old
English dub and new dubs in Hindi, Tamil and Telugu.

20
02:08:34,285 --> 02:08:40,285
The film explores themes of based on novel or book,
mythology, hinduism, hindu mythology, anime.
